#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _pages/consulting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Consulting"
msgstr "Co-comhairleachadh"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/consulting.md
msgid "If you're running an organisation that uses F-Droid or would like to use F-Droid, you will sometimes want to have an expert. This page is a list of companies and developers who contributed to F-Droid in one way or another and are available for consulting. By contracting one of these companies or developers, your organisation can also (indirectly) support the development of F-Droid."
msgstr "Ma tha thu a’ ruith buidheann a chleachdas F-Droid no nam bu mhiann leat F-Droid a chleachdadh, bidh eòlaiche gu feum dhut aig amannan. Tha liosta de chompanaidhean is luchd-leasachaidh againn a chuidich le F-Droid air dòigh air choireigin agus a tha deis ri co-comhaileachadh air an duilleag seo. Ma nì thu cùmhnant le companaidh no luchd-leasachaidh on liosta seo, cuiridh am buidheann agad taic (neo-dhìreach) ri leasachadh F-Droid le sin."

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/consulting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that the F-Droid ecosystem consists of several components. Thus, consulting services may offer a lot of different services, such as\n"
"  * Deployment of F-Droid within an organisation\n"
"  * Setup and maintenance of F-Droid repositories\n"
"  * Workshops for users and admins\n"
"  * Help in getting an app compliant for inclusion in the main f-droid.org repository\n"
"  * Bug fixes or feature additions to the F-Droid client and server components\n"
"  * Whitelabel solutions\n"
msgstr ""
"Thoir an aire gu bheil iomadh co-phàirt aig èiceo-shiostam F-Droid. Air an adhbhar sin, faodaidh seirbheisean co-chomhairleachaidh iomadh seirbheis eadar-dhealaichte a thabhann, can\n"
"  * Deployment aig F-Droid am broinn buidhinn\n"
"  * Suidheachadh is obair-ghlèidhidh air ionadan-tasgaidh F-Droid\n"
"  * Bùthan-obrach dhan luchd-chleachdaidh is do rianairean\n"
"  * Cuideachadh airson aplacaid a dhèanamh co-chòrdail ach an dèid a chur ris a’ phrìomh ionad-tasgaidh f-droid.org\n"
"  * Càradh air bugaichean no cuir ris ghleusan ùra airson cliant agus co-phàirtean frithealaiche F-Droid\n"
"  * Fuasglaidhean whitelabel\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/consulting.md
msgid "Check out the descriptions to find an appropriate consultant for your needs."
msgstr "Thoir sùil air na tuairisgeulan a lorg co-chomhairlichean iomchaidh dha na feumalachdan agad."

