msgid "Docs"
msgstr "Docamaideadh"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/docs.md
msgid "F-Droid is both a repository of verified free software Android apps as well as a whole \"app store kit\", providing all the tools needed to setup and run an app store. It is a community-run free software project developed by a wide range of contributors. It also includes complete build and release tools for managing the process of turning app source code into published builds."
msgstr "’S e an dà chuid ionad-tasgaidh de dh’aplacaidean bhathair-bhog Android saor dearbhte agus “app store kit” slàn a th’ ann an F-Droid a bheir a h-uile inneal dhut a dh’fheumas tu airson bùth aplacaidean a shuidheachadh ’s a ruith. ’S e pròiseact bathair-bhog ’ga ruith le coimhearsnachd a th’ ann a tha ’ga leasachadh le iomadh com-pàirtiche. Gabhaidh e a-staigh innealan togail is sgaoilidh slàna cuideachd airson am pròiseas a stiùireadh gus togalaichean foillsichte a dhèanamh de bhun-tùs aplacaid."

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/docs.md
msgid "The F-Droid server tools provide various scripts and tools that are used to maintain the main F-Droid application repository. You can use these same tools to create your own additional or alternative repository for publishing, or to assist in creating, testing and submitting metadata to the main repository."
msgstr "Bheir innealan frithealaiche F-Droid iomadh sgriobt is inneal dhut a tha ’gan cleachdadh airson prìomh ionad-tasgaidh aplacaidean F-Droid a ghlèidheadh. ’S urrainn dhut fhèin na h-aon innealan a chleachdadh airson an t-ionad-tasgaidh agad fhèin a chruthachadh ’na roghainn eile airson foillseachadh no airson cuideachadh le cruthachadh, cur fo dheuchainn is cur a-null meata-dàta dhan phrìomh ionad-tasgaidh."

