#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repomaker"
msgstr "Repomaker"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "F-Droid.org is just a repo out of hundreds of repos created by individuals all around the globe. With the tools of F-Droid, everyone can create their own repo. So whether you are a musician who wants to publish their music or a developer who wants to serve nightly builds of their app, you are free to create your own repo and share it with other people independently of F-Droid.org."
msgstr "Chan e ach aon ionad-tasgaidh am measg ceudan a th’ ann an F-Droid.org agus tha daoine ’gan cruthachadh air feadh an t-saoghail. Le innealan F-Droid, ’s urrainn do neach sam bith an t-ionad-tasgaidh aca fhèin a chruthachadh. Ge b’ e an e neach-ciùil a th’ annad is tu airson do chuid ciùil fhoillseachadh no neach-leasachaidh a tha airson nightly builds de dh’aplacaid a sholar, ’s urrainn dhut ionad-tasgaidh agad fhèin a chruthachadh ma thogras tu ’s a cho-roinneadh le càch gu neo-eisimeileach o F-Droid.org."

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "In the past, creating a repo has been difficult because you had to have knowledge on the command line, needed to edit text files to edit your packages' store details and had to paste screenshots in a special system of directories to have them served well inside the F-Droid app."
msgstr "Bhiodh e doirbh uair dhen t-saoghail ionad-tasgaidh a chruthachadh on a bhiodh agad ris an loidhne-àithne a thuigsinn, faidhlichean teacsa a dheasachadh airson fiosrachadh mu bhùth nam pacaidean agad a ghnàthachadh agus glacaidhean-sgrìn a chur ann le siostam sònraichte de phasganan ach an rachadh am frithealadh mar bu chòir am broinn aplacaid F-Droid."

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "This all got easier now: with Repomaker, you are able to create your own repo and do not need to have any special knowledge to do so.  Check out the [installation guide](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker/blob/master/README.md#installation)  for information on how you can install Repomaker on your device."
msgstr "Tha a h-uile càil sin mòran nas fhasa a-nis: Bheir Repomaker an comas dhut gus an t-ionad-tasgaidh agad fèin a chruthachadh gun fheum air eòlas sònraichte airson sin a dhèanamh. Thoir sùil air [treòiriche an stàlaidh](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker/blob/master/README.md#installation) airson barrachd fiosrachaidh mu mar as urrainn dhut Repomaker a stàladh air an uidheam agad."

